      <!-- ===== PIONEER RESOURCE LINKS ===== -->
      <div class="new-section">
        <div class="pioneer-links-wrap">
          <h2 class="serif">Pioneer Books, Articles, Sermons, Tracts &amp; Charts</h2>
          <div class="quote" style="margin-top:14px;margin-bottom:4px;">
            <p>&ldquo;When the power of God testifies as to what is truth, that truth is to stand forever as the truth. No after suppositions contrary to the light God has given are to be entertained&hellip; The standard-bearers who have fallen in death are to speak through the reprinting of their writings. They are to bear their testimony as to what constitutes the truth for this time.&rdquo;</p>
